Package: org.rustica.browser
Version: 3.12.0
Architecture: x86_64
Kind: app
Maintainer: The Rustux Authors <gitrustux@rustux>
Homepage: https://www.netsurf-browser.org
License: GPL-2.0-only
Description: NetSurf web browser
 NetSurf (netsurf-browser.org), a small web browser with its own HTML and
 CSS engine, on Rustica. Pages over HTTP and HTTPS; downloads go to your
 Downloads folder. No JavaScript yet. Its source and Rustica's changes
 are in the rustux repository (userspace/ports/netsurf).
